            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for a thief, then the Kannada for to run away."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವರದಿಗಾರ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವರದಿಗಾರ — varadigāra — \"a reporter\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ವರದಿಗಾರ ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಇದ್ದಿದ್ದರೆ ಎಲ್ಲರಿಗೂ ಸುದ್ದಿ ಗೊತ್ತಾಗುತ್ತಿತ್ತು. ā varadigāra alli iddiddare ellarigū suddi gottāguttittu. If that reporter had been there, everyone would have known the news."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ವರದಿಗಾರರು, varadigāraru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವರದಿ is a report; -ಗಾರ makes \"one who does it\", as in ಕೆಲಸಗಾರ, a worker."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವರದಿಗಾರ (varadigāra) is a Kannada word built from ವರದಿ, \"a report\", and the ending -gāra, \"one who does\", as in ಕೆಲಸಗಾರ. The origin of ವರದಿ itself is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
