            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ā varadigāra alli iddiddare ellarigū suddi gottāguttittu. — If that reporter had been there, everyone would have known the news.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ā varadigāra alli iddiddare ellarigū suddi gottāguttittu.* — If that reporter had been there, everyone would have known the news.]"
            },
            {
