          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಭವಿಸು — sambhavisu — \"to occur; to happen\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿನ್ನೆ ರಾತ್ರಿ ನಮ್ಮ ಬೀದಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಅಪಘಾತ ಸಂಭವಿಸಿತು. ninne rātri namma bīdiyalli apaghāta sambhavisitu. Last night an accident happened in our street."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ಸಂಭವಿಸಿತು, sambhavisitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An event is the subject, so the past is ಸಂಭವಿಸಿತು, it happened. It suits news reports."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಭವಿಸು (sambhavisu) is built on Sanskrit sambhava, \"being or coming together, arising\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada ending -isu that makes verbs of Sanskrit nouns."
            }
          ]
        },
